1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
You built it. But can you explain it? Meet RepoViva.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Upload source code or a searchable PDF. Or try the Python example without Google sign-in.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Practise explanation questions, not true-or-false guesses. Record your reasoning with Gnani Prisma speech-to-text.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Check the transcript, fix technical terms, and confirm what you meant before submitting.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Get source-backed feedback, then tackle a follow-up that probes your understanding.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Debug your own uploaded code. Inspect a deliberate bug, reveal hints, and check your repair with in-app tests.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Then defend your fix. Explain the cause and an input that exposes it. Each answer has its own recorder.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
History restores your saved practice.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Profile shows your remaining AI allowance.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
RepoViva. Upload. Explain. Repair. Defend. Built with Gnani Prisma.

